&lt;p style="font-family: Times New Roman; font-size: 10pt; margin: 0pt;"&gt;&amp;#xa0;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style="font-family: Times New Roman; font-size: 10pt; margin: 0pt;"&gt;On May 10, 2016, affiliates of a predecessor entered into a Note Purchase Agreement ("Agreement") with various investors for an aggregate principal amount of $35,000,000. On December 10, 2019, BBT purchased these notes. When Enstor bought the Trans-Union asset on 11/12/2025, the Notes were paid off at their face value. Unamortized debt issuance costs of $0.2 million were expensed in the period, and are included as interest expense in the statement of income.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style="font-family: Times New Roman; font-size: 10pt; margin: 0pt;"&gt;&amp;#xa0;&lt;/p&gt;

