&lt;p style="font-family: Times New Roman; font-size: 10pt; margin: 0pt;"&gt;&lt;b&gt;Legal Matters&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style="font-family: Times New Roman; font-size: 10pt; margin: 0pt;"&gt;&amp;#xa0;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style="font-family: Times New Roman; font-size: 10pt; margin: 0pt;"&gt;Trans-Union is involved in various legal actions arising in the ordinary course of business. While it is not feasible to predict the ultimate outcome of these actions, management believes that the resolution of these actions will not have a material effect, either individually or in the aggregate, on Trans-Union's financial position, results of operations or cash flows.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style="font-family: Times New Roman; font-size: 10pt; margin: 0pt;"&gt;&amp;#xa0;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style="font-family: Times New Roman; font-size: 10pt; margin: 0pt;"&gt;&lt;b&gt;Environmental Liabilities&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style="font-family: Times New Roman; font-size: 10pt; margin: 0pt;"&gt;&amp;#xa0;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style="font-family: Times New Roman; font-size: 10pt; margin: 0pt;"&gt;Trans-Union is not aware of any events of non-compliance with respect to environmental matters, the effects of which could have a material effect on its financial position, results of operations or cash flows.&lt;/p&gt;

